          "publisher": "Federal Reserve",
          "tier": "T0",
          "url": "https://www.federalreserve.gov/newsevents/pressreleases/monetary20261028a.htm"
        }
      ],
      "text": "10月28日Fed以10–2维持3.75%–4.00%；Cook与Hammack要求加25bp。声明形容经济强劲、就业与劳动力同步、失业率变化不大，通胀仍高，需要更多信息。",
      "type": "fact"
    },
    {
      "as_of": "2026-10-31T17:21:33.217142+00:00",
      "id": "C5",
      "sources": [
        {
